<http://data.silknow.org/object/6eb2f4f4-3a40-385e-a82e-f27e3dab1417/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Parasol with mother of pearl handle and ferrule. The outer cover is of Brussels lace and the second, finer machine mesh is used in places in imitation of needle lace. A delicate pattern of floral sprays set within arcades of flower heads cover the top of the parasol. It has a double under cover of brown and cream silk which conceals the metal ribs."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/6eb2f4f4-3a40-385e-a82e-f27e3dab1417> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/6eb2f4f4-3a40-385e-a82e-f27e3dab1417>
